  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1239009,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1001 Crew #09: The Lost City of Zerzura (Commodore 64)\n\nVenture into the scorching sands of the Sahara in *1001 Crew #09: The Lost City of Zerzura*, a thrilling text adventure for the Commodore 64! As a member of the intrepid 1001 Crew, you're tasked with locating the legendary Lost City of Zerzura, a mythical oasis brimming with untold riches and ancient secrets.\n\nGuided by cryptic clues from a tattered map and the wisdom of local Berber tribes, you'll navigate treacherous dunes, evade deadly desert creatures, and decipher perplexing riddles.  The game features a complex parser allowing for nuanced commands, and a richly detailed world brought to life through evocative prose.  \n\nBeware! The desert holds dangers beyond the physical – rival treasure hunters and ancient guardians stand between you and Zerzura.  Careful planning, resource management (water is crucial!), and sharp wit are essential for survival.  Will you uncover the secrets of Zerzura and claim its treasures, or become another lost soul swallowed by the sands?  Prepare for a challenging and rewarding adventure!"
    },
